SUMMARY:🥗 Lunch: Garlic Butter Pasta
DESCRIPTION:Recipe: Garlic Butter Pasta\nServings: 4\nPrep: 5 min | Cook: 15 min | Total: 20 min\n\n--- Ingredients ---\n• 1 lb spaghetti\n• 4 tbsp butter\n• 6 clove garlic\n• 0.5 tsp red pepper flakes\n• 0.5 cup parmesan cheese\n• 0.25 cup fresh parsley\n• 1 tbsp olive oil\n• 1 lemon\n\n--- Steps ---\n1. Cook spaghetti in salted water according to package. Reserve 1 cup pasta water before draining.\n2. Mince garlic. Melt butter with olive oil in a large pan over medium heat.\n3. Add garlic and red pepper flakes, cook 1-2 minutes until fragrant (don't burn).\n4. Add drained pasta and 1/2 cup reserved pasta water. Toss to coat.\n5. Add parmesan, squeeze of lemon juice, and parsley. Toss again, adding more pasta water if needed.\n\nTip: Add grilled chicken or shrimp for protein. Works with any pasta shape.
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
